        "continued_by": [
          "voxel-guidance-004"
        ]
      },
      "result_summary": "Block actions alone reproduced the full model's predictions. Movement alone retained a strong held-seed signal. Coarse inventory flow alone did not reliably beat chance, and removing inventory did not change the full result. Removing either block actions or movement reduced ac…",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/yurei-so/research/blob/main/experiments/voxel-guidance/docs/labnotes/voxel-guidance-003-task-inference-ablation.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "voxel-guidance-004",
      "family": "voxel-guidance",
      "title": "Machine-native state serialization baseline",
      "date": "2026-09-10",
      "status": "complete",
      "outcome": "mixed",
